The '''Quarren headquarters''' was the [[capital]] for the [[Quarren]] people of the [[water]] [[planet]] [[Mon Cala]]; located in [[Quarren Town]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[commander]] [[Riff Tamson]] used this facility to stage an [[Battle of Mon Cala|attack]] on the [[Mon Calamari]] people and their [[Coral City|capital]] [[city]].<ref name="Water War" />

